# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Veterinary supplies on you and the followers around you, never over a running kit.
# The kit is a tamer's self bandage, and it keeps being tried for the pets at full health:
# with no one to heal the server answers "do not require healing" and applies nothing.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ wait
#
#   interval__vet_refused
#      How long the next try for the pets waits after "You or your nearby followers do not
#      require healing.", or after the supplies ran out. A hurt pass does not wait.
#
#   interval__vet_running
#      How long a kit that began is taken as running when its finish line was missed. The
#      kit takes the Veterinary bandage time, 5 seconds, on yourself as on the pets.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@setvar! interval__vet_refused 2000
@setvar! interval__vet_running 7000


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ timer
#
#   timer__vet_kit
#      Ready on the first pass.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
timer__vet_kit interval__vet_running


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ state
#
#   var__vet_running
#      1 from a use until its finish line, so the next use cannot cancel it.
#
#   var__vet_wait
#      How long after the last use or answer, on timer__vet_kit, the next try for the pets
#      goes: 0 after a finish, interval__vet_refused after a refusal.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@setvar! var__vet_running 0
@setvar! var__vet_wait 0


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ loop
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # VET KIT
    #
    # Veterinary supplies (25750), the self bandage that also reaches the followers.
    #   running  A kit that began is left alone until "You finish using veterinary
    #            supplies", because using the supplies again cancels it.
    #            interval__vet_running ends the wait when another insysmsg consumed that
    #            line first.
    #   hurt     Any hit point loss sends the kit at once.
    #   pets     At full health the kit goes once var__vet_wait has passed: at once after a
    #            finish, and interval__vet_refused after "do not require healing". diffhits
    #            reads only our own hit points, so that answer is the pets' health check.
    # Bandaging gates it too, since a manual bandage on a pet would be cancelled the same
    # way. The answer is read on the spot. With no answer the kit is taken as running, so a
    # late begin line cannot let the next pass cancel it.
    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    if var__vet_running = 1
        if insysmsg "You finish using veterinary supplies"
            @setvar! var__vet_running 0
            @setvar! var__vet_wait 0
        elseif timer "timer__vet_kit" >= interval__vet_running
            @setvar! var__vet_running 0
            @setvar! var__vet_wait 0
        endif
    endif

    if var__vet_running = 0 and not bandaging and not hidden and not queued and not targetexists
        if diffhits > 0 or timer "timer__vet_kit" >= var__vet_wait
            settimer "timer__vet_kit" 0
            if findtype 25750 backpack as alias__vet_kit
                dclick alias__vet_kit
                @setvar! var__vet_running 1
                for 20
                    if insysmsg "You begin using veterinary supplies"
                        break
                    endif
                    if insysmsg "do not require healing"
                        @setvar! var__vet_running 0
                        break
                    endif
                    wait wait__poll
                endfor

                # Nothing was applied. A hurt pass tries again at once, the pets after the wait.
                if var__vet_running = 0
                    @setvar! var__vet_wait interval__vet_refused
                    settimer "timer__vet_kit" 0
                endif
            else
                # Out of supplies. Looked up again after the same wait, or at once when hurt.
                @setvar! var__vet_wait interval__vet_refused
                if timer "timer__message" >= interval__message
                    overhead "[ vet kit, out ]" 254
                    settimer "timer__message" 0
                endif
            endif
        endif
    endif
